# Keep the build context small and never ship secrets, the local database, the export or uploads.
# (The Dockerfile copies app/, docs/, data/invoices/, data/invoices_v2/ and data/cache/ explicitly: the cache holds
# the real Gemini extractions and drafts of the sample documents, so the image shows them without a key.)
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.env
.env.*
tests
deploy
Makefile
README.md
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
data/velox.db
data/velox.db-*
data/export
data/invoices/inbound
docs/img
pytest.ini
